   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Blue-hour pastel: median ~102, blue-violet shadows (43,43,63), cool highlights (210,204,217), 86% of colour mass in blue and purple, sky (103,104,157) hue 239, saturation 0.28. Best for: Blue hour and twilight, snow and alpine scenes, pastel dawn skies, cool misty mornings, soft couple frames after sunset. Cool look - do not use on warm tungsten scenes.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
